Number = {1},
Pages = {67-76},
Month = {JAN},
Abstract = {This paper presents an overview of the integrated Spatial Analysis and
   Modeling Tool (SAMT). SAMT has been designed to integrate models from
   different sciences such as economics and ecology. This is necessary for
   the evaluation of sustain ability of landscapes. Traditional geographic
   information systems and modeling systems have specific limitations. To
   overcome such limitations, the new tool has been developed with the
   emphasis on interactive spatial simulation. Major advances are
