   Rasmussen, Claus, Aarhus Univ, Dept Agroecol, Foulum, Denmark.
   Skoog, Daniel I. J.; Hanevik, Kaj-Andreas, Norwegian Univ Life Sci, Fac Environm Sci \& Nat Resource Management, As, Norway.
