   Kline, Jenna; Stewart, Christopher; Berger-Wolf, Tanya, Ohio State Univ, Dept Comp Sci \& Engn, Columbus, OH 43210 USA.
   Afridi, Saadia; Rolland, Edouard G. A.; Maalouf, Guy, Univ Southern Denmark, Unmanned Aerial Syst Ctr, Odense, Denmark.
   Laporte-Devylder, Lucie, Univ Southern Denmark, Dept Biol, Odense, Denmark.
